262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 155 0 R
/E (I lead the content team, overseeing its creative direction, content planning and production workflow. I developed the team's brief and rota, established roles and responsibilities across the creative process, and facilitate regular review meetings. At the beginning of each month, I lead content planning and coordinate the production schedule. I also take an active role in shooting, editing and publishing content, as well as managing the Instagram page. Through this work, I have helped build a more structured and collaborative creative team, bringing ideas from concept to publication.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
